{
  "lessonId": "L1M2L2",
  "title": "Tuscany 托斯卡納 - 經典之美",
  "content": "<div class='slides'><section class='slide-cover' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#c0392b 0%,#e74c3c 100%)'><h1>🌿 Toscana 托斯卡納</h1><p class='subtitle'>經典義式風情的代名詞</p></section><section class='slide tuscany-map-slide' style='padding:0'><div class='tuscany-map-container' style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr;gap:20px;height:100%;padding:20px;background:#1a1a2e;border-radius:12px'><div id='tuscany-map' class='tuscany-region-map' style='border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.3)'></div><div class='map-legend'><h3 style='margin:0 0 20px;color:#c0392b;font-size:1.3rem;text-align:center'>🌿 Tuscany 產區地圖</h3><div style='margin-bottom:25px;padding:15px;background:rgba(192,57,43,.15);border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #c0392b'><p style='margin:0;color:#ecf0f1;line-height:1.7;font-size:.95rem'>Sangiovese之鄉，經典義式風情代名詞</p></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#d4af37;font-size:1.1rem;border-bottom:2px solid #d4af37;padding-bottom:8px'>🏆 S級 DOCG</h4><button onclick='zoomToTuscanyRegion(&quot;Brunello di Montalcino DOCG&quot;)' style='width:100%;text-align:left;margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(139,0,0,.1);border:none;border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #8B0000;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.3s' onmouseenter='this.style.background=&quot;rgba(139,0,0,.2)&quot;' onmouseleave='this.style.background=&quot;rgba(139,0,0,.1)&quot;'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#8B0000;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#8B0000'>Brunello di Montalcino</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>100% Sangiovese，5年陳年</p></button><button onclick='zoomToTuscanyRegion(&quot;Chianti Classico DOCG&quot;)' style='width:100%;text-align:left;margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(165,42,42,.1);border:none;border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #A52A2A;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.3s' onmouseenter='this.style.background=&quot;rgba(165,42,42,.2)&quot;' onmouseleave='this.style.background=&quot;rgba(165,42,42,.1)&quot;'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#A52A2A;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#A52A2A'>Chianti Classico</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>黑公雞標誌，最經典</p></button></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#27ae60;font-size:1.1rem;border-bottom:2px solid #27ae60;padding-bottom:8px'>⭐ A級 DOCG</h4><button onclick='zoomToTuscanyRegion(&quot;Chianti DOCG&quot;)' style='width:100%;text-align:left;margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(22,160,133,.1);border:none;border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #16a085;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.3s' onmouseenter='this.style.background=&quot;rgba(22,160,133,.2)&quot;' onmouseleave='this.style.background=&quot;rgba(22,160,133,.1)&quot;'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#16a085;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#16a085'>Chianti DOCG</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>親民價格，日常餐酒</p></button><button onclick='zoomToTuscanyRegion(&quot;Vino Nobile di Montepulciano DOCG&quot;)' style='width:100%;text-align:left;margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(39,174,96,.1);border:none;border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #27ae60;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.3s' onmouseenter='this.style.background=&quot;rgba(39,174,96,.2)&quot;' onmouseleave='this.style.background=&quot;rgba(39,174,96,.1)&quot;'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#27ae60;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#27ae60'>Vino Nobile di Montepulciano</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>介於Chianti與Brunello之間</p></button></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px'><h4 style='margin:0 0 12px;color:#3498db;font-size:1.1rem;border-bottom:2px solid #3498db;padding-bottom:8px'>💎 B級產區</h4><button onclick='zoomToTuscanyRegion(&quot;Vernaccia di San Gimignano DOCG&quot;)' style='width:100%;text-align:left;margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(52,152,219,.1);border:none;border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #3498db;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.3s' onmouseenter='this.style.background=&quot;rgba(52,152,219,.2)&quot;' onmouseleave='this.style.background=&quot;rgba(52,152,219,.1)&quot;'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#3498db;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#3498db'>Vernaccia di San Gimignano</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>托斯卡納白酒代表</p></button><button onclick='zoomToTuscanyRegion(&quot;Morellino di Scansano DOCG&quot;)' style='width:100%;text-align:left;margin:8px 0;padding:10px;background:rgba(93,173,226,.1);border:none;border-radius:6px;border-left:3px solid #5DADE2;cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.3s' onmouseenter='this.style.background=&quot;rgba(93,173,226,.2)&quot;' onmouseleave='this.style.background=&quot;rgba(93,173,226,.1)&quot;'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;margin-bottom:5px'><div style='width:16px;height:16px;background:#5DADE2;border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px'></div><strong style='color:#5DADE2'>Morellino di Scansano</strong></div><p style='margin:5px 0 0 26px;color:#bdc3c7;font-size:.88rem;line-height:1.6'>海岸區紅酒</p></button></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>📍 產區概況</h2><div class='region-overview'><div class='overview-item'><div class='overview-label'>位置</div><div class='overview-value'>義大利中部，亞平寧山脈</div></div><div class='overview-item'><div class='overview-label'>首府</div><div class='overview-value'>Firenze 佛羅倫斯</div></div><div class='overview-item'><div class='overview-label'>葡萄園面積</div><div class='overview-value'>~63,000 公頃</div></div><div class='overview-item'><div class='overview-label'>DOCG 數量</div><div class='overview-value'>11 個</div></div><div class='overview-item'><div class='overview-label'>主要品種</div><div class='overview-value'>Sangiovese (90%)</div></div><div class='overview-item'><div class='overview-label'>氣候</div><div class='overview-value'>地中海氣候，溫暖乾燥</div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🏛️ 歷史與文化地位</h2><div class='history-culture'><div class='timeline-section'><h3>📜 葡萄酒歷史時間軸</h3><div class='timeline'><div class='timeline-item' style='border-left-color:#8e44ad'><div class='timeline-year'>伊特魯里亞時期</div><div class='timeline-desc'>公元前8世紀開始種植葡萄，托斯卡納葡萄酒文化起源</div></div><div class='timeline-item' style='border-left-color:#e67e22'><div class='timeline-year'>文藝復興時期</div><div class='timeline-desc'>Medici 家族推動葡萄酒產業發展，藝術與葡萄酒齊放</div></div><div class='timeline-item' style='border-left-color:#c0392b'><div class='timeline-year'>1716年</div><div class='timeline-desc'>Cosimo III 劃定Chianti產區邊界，<strong>世界第一個法定葡萄酒產區</strong></div></div><div class='timeline-item' style='border-left-color:#16a085'><div class='timeline-year'>1872年</div><div class='timeline-desc'>Baron Ricasoli 確立Chianti配方：Sangiovese為主體的混釀公式</div></div><div class='timeline-item' style='border-left-color:#2980b9'><div class='timeline-year'>1970年代</div><div class='timeline-desc'>超級托斯卡納誕生，挑戰傳統法規，開創國際化風格</div></div></div></div><div class='culture-icons'><h3>🎨 文化象徵</h3><div class='culture-grid'><div class='culture-card'><div class='culture-emoji'>🎭</div><h4>文藝復興搖籃</h4><p>達文西、米開朗基羅的故鄉，藝術與葡萄酒的完美結合</p></div><div class='culture-card'><div class='culture-emoji'>📚</div><h4>義大利語發源地</h4><p>但丁《神曲》使用托斯卡納方言，成為現代義大利語基礎</p></div><div class='culture-card'><div class='culture-emoji'>👑</div><h4>Medici 家族影響</h4><p>14-18世紀統治者，推動葡萄酒品質提升與國際貿易</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🌍 風土條件深度分析</h2><div class='terroir-analysis'><div class='climate-section'><h3>☀️ 氣候特徵</h3><div class='climate-grid'><div class='climate-card'><div class='climate-label'>氣候類型</div><div class='climate-value'>地中海氣候</div><div class='climate-detail'>溫暖乾燥，降雨集中秋冬</div></div><div class='climate-card'><div class='climate-label'>年均溫</div><div class='climate-value'>14-16°C</div><div class='climate-detail'>生長季溫和，利於酸度保持</div></div><div class='climate-card'><div class='climate-label'>日夜溫差</div><div class='climate-value'>10-15°C</div><div class='climate-detail'>高海拔產區溫差更大</div></div><div class='climate-card'><div class='climate-label'>年降雨量</div><div class='climate-value'>700-900mm</div><div class='climate-detail'>夏季乾燥，秋季適度降雨</div></div></div></div><div class='soil-comparison'><h3>🪨 土壤類型比較</h3><table class='soil-table'><thead><tr><th>土壤類型</th><th>特性</th><th>主要產區</th><th>葡萄酒風格</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Galestro</strong><br>片岩土壤</td><td>富含泥灰岩碎片<br>排水性極佳<br>礦物質豐富</td><td>Chianti Classico<br>核心區域</td><td>優雅、礦物感<br>高酸度</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Alberese</strong><br>石灰岩</td><td>白色石灰岩<br>保水能力強<br>鈣質豐富</td><td>Montalcino<br>部分區域</td><td>結構強勁<br>陳年潛力</td></tr><tr><td><strong>砂質土</strong><br>Sand</td><td>顆粒粗、質地輕<br>早熟產區</td><td>Bolgheri<br>海岸區</td><td>果香奔放<br>單寧柔順</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Tufo</strong><br>凝灰岩</td><td>火山起源<br>礦物質多樣</td><td>Montepulciano</td><td>複雜度高<br>獨特風味</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class='elevation-analysis'><h3>⛰️ 海拔梯度與品質</h3><div class='elevation-chart'><div class='elevation-tier' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#d4af37,#f1c40f)'><div class='tier-height'>350-500m</div><div class='tier-label'>頂級產區</div><div class='tier-features'>• 溫差最大 • 成熟緩慢 • 風味複雜度最高 • Gran Selezione等級</div></div><div class='elevation-tier' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#27ae60,#2ecc71)'><div class='tier-height'>200-350m</div><div class='tier-label'>優質產區</div><div class='tier-features'>• 均衡氣候 • 最佳風土 • Riserva等級 • 酸度與成熟度平衡</div></div><div class='elevation-tier' style='background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3498db,#5dade2)'><div class='tier-height'>100-200m</div><div class='tier-label'>基礎產區</div><div class='tier-features'>• 溫暖氣候 • 早熟區域 • Normale等級 • 日常餐酒</div></div></div></div><div class='geography-factors'><h3>🗺️ 地理影響因素</h3><div class='geo-grid'><div class='geo-item'><strong>🏔️ 亞平寧山脈</strong><p>東側屏障，阻擋冷空氣，創造溫和微氣候</p></div><div class='geo-item'><strong>🌊 地中海</strong><p>西側海洋調節，Bolgheri等海岸產區受海風影響</p></div><div class='geo-item'><strong>🏞️ Arno河谷</strong><p>河流穿越佛羅倫斯，創造獨特中間氣候區</p></div><div class='geo-item'><strong>☀️ 坡向</strong><p>南向、西南向坡面最佳，日照充足利於成熟</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍇 Sangiovese - 托斯卡納之魂</h2><div class='grape-profile'><div class='grape-header'><div class='grape-icon'>🍷</div><h3>Sangiovese</h3><p>義大利種植面積最大的品種</p></div><div class='grape-characteristics'><div class='characteristic'><strong>顏色</strong><br>寶石紅，邊緣略帶橙色</div><div class='characteristic'><strong>香氣</strong><br>櫻桃、李子、紫羅蘭、茶葉</div><div class='characteristic'><strong>口感</strong><br>高酸、中高單寧、中等酒體</div><div class='characteristic'><strong>陳年</strong><br>5-20 年（視等級而定）</div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🧬 Sangiovese 克隆與地方變種</h2><div class='sangiovese-clones'><div class='clone-intro'><p style='background:rgba(192,57,43,0.1);padding:15px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #c0392b;margin-bottom:20px'>Sangiovese 有超過<strong>100種克隆</strong>，各產區培育出獨特地方變種，風格差異顯著</p></div><div class='local-varieties'><h3>🌿 主要地方變種</h3><div class='variety-list'><div class='variety-card featured-variety'><div class='variety-header'><h4>Brunello (Sangiovese Grosso)</h4><div class='variety-badge'>Montalcino 專屬</div></div><div class='variety-details'><div class='variety-trait'>🔴 <strong>特性：</strong>果粒最大、皮厚、晚熟</div><div class='variety-trait'>💪 <strong>單寧：</strong>最高等級，需長時間陳年</div><div class='variety-trait'>⏰ <strong>成熟期：</strong>比標準Sangiovese晚2-3週</div><div class='variety-trait'>🎯 <strong>風格：</strong>強勁、複雜、陳年潛力20-30年</div></div></div><div class='variety-card'><div class='variety-header'><h4>Prugnolo Gentile</h4><div class='variety-badge'>Montepulciano</div></div><div class='variety-details'><div class='variety-trait'>🔴 <strong>特性：</strong>介於Brunello與標準Sangiovese</div><div class='variety-trait'>💪 <strong>單寧：</strong>中高，柔順度較佳</div><div class='variety-trait'>⏰ <strong>成熟期：</strong>中晚熟</div><div class='variety-trait'>🎯 <strong>風格：</strong>優雅、李子風味明顯</div></div></div><div class='variety-card'><div class='variety-header'><h4>Morellino</h4><div class='variety-badge'>Scansano 海岸</div></div><div class='variety-details'><div class='variety-trait'>🔴 <strong>特性：</strong>適應溫暖氣候，果香奔放</div><div class='variety-trait'>💪 <strong>單寧：</strong>柔和，易飲型</div><div class='variety-trait'>⏰ <strong>成熟期：</strong>較早熟</div><div class='variety-trait'>🎯 <strong>風格：</strong>新鮮水果香、親民價格</div></div></div><div class='variety-card'><div class='variety-header'><h4>Sangioveto</h4><div class='variety-badge'>Chianti Classico</div></div><div class='variety-details'><div class='variety-trait'>🔴 <strong>特性：</strong>傳統Chianti克隆總稱</div><div class='variety-trait'>💪 <strong>單寧：</strong>中高，酸度突出</div><div class='variety-trait'>⏰ <strong>成熟期：</strong>中晚熟</div><div class='variety-trait'>🎯 <strong>風格：</strong>經典櫻桃酸度、茶葉氣息</div></div></div></div></div><div class='modern-clones'><h3>🔬 現代商業克隆</h3><table class='clone-table'><thead><tr><th>克隆編號</th><th>選育年代</th><th>特點</th><th>主要使用產區</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>BF 30</strong></td><td>1970s</td><td>產量中等、品質均衡、最廣泛使用</td><td>Chianti Classico</td></tr><tr><td><strong>R24</strong></td><td>1980s</td><td>低產量、高濃縮度、著色深</td><td>頂級Brunello</td></tr><tr><td><strong>VCR 4</strong></td><td>1990s</td><td>抗病性強、果實濃郁、現代風格</td><td>超級托斯卡納</td></tr><tr><td><strong>T19</strong></td><td>1970s</td><td>高酸度、優雅風格、傳統偏好</td><td>Chianti Rufina</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class='clone-comparison'><h3>📊 風格差異對比</h3><div class='comparison-meter'><div class='meter-row'><span class='meter-label'>單寧強度</span><div class='meter-bar'><div class='meter-fill morellino' style='width:40%'><span>Morellino</span></div><div class='meter-fill sangioveto' style='width:70%'><span>Sangioveto</span></div><div class='meter-fill brunello' style='width:95%'><span>Brunello</span></div></div></div><div class='meter-row'><span class='meter-label'>陳年潛力</span><div class='meter-bar'><div class='meter-fill morellino' style='width:30%'><span>Morellino</span></div><div class='meter-fill sangioveto' style='width:65%'><span>Sangioveto</span></div><div class='meter-fill brunello' style='width:98%'><span>Brunello</span></div></div></div><div class='meter-row'><span class='meter-label'>果香表現</span><div class='meter-bar'><div class='meter-fill morellino' style='width:90%'><span>Morellino</span></div><div class='meter-fill sangioveto' style='width:70%'><span>Sangioveto</span></div><div class='meter-fill brunello' style='width:60%'><span>Brunello</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🏆 Chianti 分級與子產區</h2><div class='chianti-classification'><div class='classification-intro'><h3>🗺️ Chianti DOCG 產區架構</h3><p style='margin:10px 0 20px;line-height:1.7'>Chianti DOCG涵蓋7大子產區，而<strong>Chianti Classico DOCG</strong>是獨立的頂級產區，擁有自己的分級體系</p></div><div class='subzones-section'><h3>📍 Chianti 七大子產區</h3><div class='subzones-grid'><div class='subzone-card'><div class='subzone-name'>Colli Fiorentini</div><div class='subzone-desc'>佛羅倫斯丘陵，優雅風格</div></div><div class='subzone-card'><div class='subzone-name'>Colli Senesi</div><div class='subzone-desc'>Siena周邊，最大子產區</div></div><div class='subzone-card'><div class='subzone-name'>Colli Aretini</div><div class='subzone-desc'>Arezzo區，傳統風格</div></div><div class='subzone-card highlight-subzone'><div class='subzone-name'>Rufina</div><div class='subzone-desc'>⭐ 品質最優，高海拔冷涼</div></div><div class='subzone-card'><div class='subzone-name'>Montalbano</div><div class='subzone-desc'>小產區，輕盈風格</div></div><div class='subzone-card'><div class='subzone-name'>Colline Pisane</div><div class='subzone-desc'>Pisa丘陵，柔順口感</div></div><div class='subzone-card'><div class='subzone-name'>Montespertoli</div><div class='subzone-desc'>2002新增，現代發展</div></div></div></div><div class='aging-classification'><h3>⏱️ Chianti Classico 陳年等級</h3><table class='aging-table'><thead><tr><th>等級</th><th>陳年要求</th><th>酒精度</th><th>Sangiovese比例</th><th>風格特徵</th><th>價格帶</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Annata/Normale</strong></td><td>上市前1年<br>(其中3個月瓶中)</td><td>最低12%</td><td>80% 以上</td><td>新鮮果香、活潑酸度<br>日常餐酒</td><td>€€</td></tr><tr class='riserva-row'><td><strong>Riserva</strong></td><td>最低24個月<br>(3個月瓶中)</td><td>最低12.5%</td><td>80% 以上</td><td>結構複雜、橡木桶風味<br>陳年潛力5-10年</td><td>€€€</td></tr><tr class='gran-selezione-row'><td><strong>Gran Selezione</strong><br><span style='font-size:0.85em;color:#e67e22'>2014年新增</span></td><td>最低30個月<br>(3個月瓶中)<br><strong>需來自單一莊園</strong></td><td>最低13%</td><td>80% 以上</td><td>最高品質、風土表現<br>陳年潛力10-20年<br>頂級田塊</td><td>€€€€</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class='classico-vs-chianti'><h3>🆚 Chianti Classico vs Chianti 比較</h3><div class='comparison-boxes'><div class='comparison-box classico-box'><h4>Chianti Classico DOCG</h4><ul><li>✓ 獨立DOCG（1996年）</li><li>✓ 歷史核心產區（1716劃定）</li><li>✓ 黑公雞標誌 (Gallo Nero)</li><li>✓ 更嚴格規範</li><li>✓ 風土特徵：Galestro土壤</li><li>✓ 平均品質更高</li></ul></div><div class='comparison-box chianti-box'><h4>Chianti DOCG</h4><ul><li>✓ 涵蓋7個子產區</li><li>✓ 更大產區範圍</li><li>✓ 無統一標誌</li><li>✓ 法規相對寬鬆</li><li>✓ 風土多樣化</li><li>✓ 價格更親民</li></ul></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>⭐ 五大必學 DOCG</h2><div class='docg-list'><div class='docg-card featured'><div class='docg-rank'>#1</div><div class='docg-content'><h3>Brunello di Montalcino DOCG</h3><p class='docg-grape'>100% Sangiovese (Brunello)</p><p class='docg-aging'>⏱️ 最低陳年：5年（2年橡木桶）</p><p class='docg-style'>🎯 風格：強勁、複雜、陳年潛力極強</p><p class='docg-price'>💰 價格：$$$$</p></div></div><div class='docg-card'><div class='docg-rank'>#2</div><div class='docg-content'><h3>Chianti Classico DOCG</h3><p class='docg-grape'>80-100% Sangiovese</p><p class='docg-aging'>⏱️ 陳年：Riserva 至少 24個月</p><p class='docg-style'>🎯 風格：酸度活潑、櫻桃風味、黑公雞標誌</p><p class='docg-price'>💰 價格：$$-$$$</p></div></div><div class='docg-card'><div class='docg-rank'>#3</div><div class='docg-content'><h3>Vino Nobile di Montepulciano</h3><p class='docg-grape'>70% Sangiovese (Prugnolo Gentile)</p><p class='docg-aging'>⏱️ 陳年：Riserva 至少 3年</p><p class='docg-style'>🎯 風格：介於 Chianti 和 Brunello 之間</p><p class='docg-price'>💰 價格：$$-$$$</p></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🌟 超級托斯卡納</h2><div class='super-tuscan'><div class='super-tuscan-intro'><h3>打破傳統的革命</h3><p>1970年代，酒莊開始使用國際品種（Cabernet Sauvignon, Merlot）混釀或單釀，創造出高品質但只能標示為 IGT 的葡萄酒</p></div><div class='super-tuscan-examples'><div class='example-wine'><div class='wine-name'>Sassicaia</div><div class='wine-blend'>Cabernet Sauvignon + Cabernet Franc</div><div class='wine-status'>第一款超級托斯卡納 (1968)</div></div><div class='example-wine'><div class='wine-name'>Tignanello</div><div class='wine-blend'>Sangiovese + Cabernet</div><div class='wine-status'>Antinori 經典之作</div></div><div class='example-wine'><div class='wine-name'>Ornellaia</div><div class='wine-blend'>Bordeaux 品種混釀</div><div class='wine-status'>國際級頂尖酒款</div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🚀 超級托斯卡納深度探索</h2><div class='super-tuscan-deep'><div class='rebellion-story'><h3>⚔️ 叛逆的誕生背景</h3><div class='story-timeline'><div class='story-phase'><div class='phase-year'>1960年代</div><div class='phase-content'><strong>傳統法規的限制</strong><p>DOC法規要求Chianti必須混入白葡萄，且禁止使用國際品種如Cabernet Sauvignon</p></div></div><div class='story-phase'><div class='phase-year'>1968-1971</div><div class='phase-content'><strong>創新者的實驗</strong><p>Marchese Incisa della Rocchetta (Sassicaia)、Piero Antinori (Tignanello) 開始嘗試突破傳統框架</p></div></div><div class='story-phase'><div class='phase-year'>1970年代</div><div class='phase-content'><strong>品質勝過法規</strong><p>這些「違規」葡萄酒獲得國際讚譽，只能標示為Vino da Tavola（餐酒），但售價遠超DOCG</p></div></div></div></div><div class='iconic-wines'><h3>🍷 經典超托酒款深入</h3><div class='iconic-wine-cards'><div class='iconic-card sassicaia-card'><div class='wine-header'><h4>Sassicaia</h4><div class='wine-year'>首年份：1968</div></div><div class='wine-body'><p class='wine-blend-detail'><strong>混釀：</strong>85% Cabernet Sauvignon + 15% Cabernet Franc</p><p class='wine-region'><strong>產區：</strong>Bolgheri (現為Bolgheri Sassicaia DOC)</p><p class='wine-style'><strong>風格：</strong>優雅、波爾多左岸風格、雪松香氣</p><p class='wine-story'><strong>故事：</strong>Tenuta San Guido酒莊，種植於海岸礫石土壤，被譽為「義大利的Lafite」</p><p class='wine-price'>💰 €200-400</p></div></div><div class='iconic-card tignanello-card'><div class='wine-header'><h4>Tignanello</h4><div class='wine-year'>首年份：1971</div></div><div class='wine-body'><p class='wine-blend-detail'><strong>混釀：</strong>80% Sangiovese + 15% Cabernet Sauvignon + 5% Cabernet Franc</p><p class='wine-region'><strong>產區：</strong>Chianti Classico區內</p><p class='wine-style'><strong>風格：</strong>Sangiovese主導、國際品種增添結構、平衡優雅</p><p class='wine-story'><strong>故事：</strong>Antinori家族創新，第一款不使用白葡萄、採用Barrique小橡木桶的Sangiovese</p><p class='wine-price'>💰 €100-200</p></div></div><div class='iconic-card ornellaia-card'><div class='wine-header'><h4>Ornellaia</h4><div class='wine-year'>首年份：1985</div></div><div class='wine-body'><p class='wine-blend-detail'><strong>混釀：</strong>50% Cabernet Sauvignon + 25% Merlot + 20% Cabernet Franc + 5% Petit Verdot</p><p class='wine-region'><strong>產區：</strong>Bolgheri</p><p class='wine-style'><strong>風格：</strong>豐滿、奢華、強勁、國際風格</p><p class='wine-story'><strong>故事：</strong>Lodovico Antinori創立，現由Frescobaldi家族經營，與Sassicaia為鄰</p><p class='wine-price'>💰 €150-300</p></div></div><div class='iconic-card masseto-card'><div class='wine-header'><h4>Masseto</h4><div class='wine-year'>首年份：1986</div></div><div class='wine-body'><p class='wine-blend-detail'><strong>混釀：</strong>100% Merlot</p><p class='wine-region'><strong>產區：</strong>Bolgheri</p><p class='wine-style'><strong>風格：</strong>極致濃郁、天鵝絨般質地、頂級Merlot</p><p class='wine-story'><strong>故事：</strong>Ornellaia莊園內7公頃特殊黏土田塊，被譽為「義大利的Petrus」</p><p class='wine-price'>💰 €500-1000+</p></div></div><div class='iconic-card solaia-card'><div class='wine-header'><h4>Solaia</h4><div class='wine-year'>首年份：1978</div></div><div class='wine-body'><p class='wine-blend-detail'><strong>混釀：</strong>75% Cabernet Sauvignon + 20% Sangiovese + 5% Cabernet Franc</p><p class='wine-region'><strong>產區：</strong>Chianti Classico</p><p class='wine-style'><strong>風格：</strong>Cabernet主導、強勁結構、陳年潛力強</p><p class='wine-story'><strong>故事：</strong>Antinori旗艦酒款，與Tignanello為鄰園，Solaia意為「向陽之地」</p><p class='wine-price'>💰 €200-400</p></div></div></div></div><div class='bolgheri-rise'><h3>🌊 Bolgheri 產區的崛起</h3><div class='bolgheri-content'><div class='bolgheri-timeline'><div class='bolgheri-event'><strong>1968</strong> - Sassicaia首發，海岸產區展現潛力</div><div class='bolgheri-event'><strong>1994</strong> - Bolgheri DOC建立，超托獲得官方認可</div><div class='bolgheri-event'><strong>2013</strong> - Bolgheri Sassicaia DOC（單一酒款專屬DOC）</div></div><div class='bolgheri-features'><h4>Bolgheri 風土特色</h4><ul><li>🌊 <strong>海岸氣候</strong>：地中海海風調節，溫暖穩定</li><li>🪨 <strong>礫石土壤</strong>：類似波爾多左岸，排水性優異</li><li>🍇 <strong>國際品種</strong>：Cabernet、Merlot表現極佳</li><li>💎 <strong>頂級酒莊</strong>：Sassicaia、Ornellaia、Masseto、Guado al Tasso</li></ul></div></div></div><div class='market-comparison'><h3>💰 市場定位與評分</h3><table class='market-table'><thead><tr><th>酒款</th><th>平均價格</th><th>Wine Advocate</th><th>陳年潛力</th><th>與Brunello比較</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Sassicaia</td><td>€250-350</td><td>95-98</td><td>20-30年</td><td>價格相當，國際風格</td></tr><tr><td>Masseto</td><td>€600-900</td><td>96-100</td><td>20-40年</td><td>價格高2-3倍，稀有度更高</td></tr><tr><td>Tignanello</td><td>€120-180</td><td>93-96</td><td>15-25年</td><td>價格略低，Sangiovese風格</td></tr><tr><td>Ornellaia</td><td>€180-280</td><td>94-98</td><td>20-30年</td><td>價格相當，更國際化</td></tr><tr><td>Brunello Riserva</td><td>€80-300</td><td>94-98</td><td>20-30年</td><td>傳統旗艦，品質與頂級超托並駕齊驅</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🍽️ 餐酒搭配</h2><div class='pairing-grid'><div class='pairing-card'><div class='food-icon'>🥩</div><h4>Bistecca alla Fiorentina</h4><p>佛羅倫斯 T骨牛排</p><p class='pairing-wine'>→ Chianti Classico Riserva</p></div><div class='pairing-card'><div class='food-icon'>🍝</div><h4>野豬肉醬義大利麵</h4><p>Pappardelle al Cinghiale</p><p class='pairing-wine'>→ Brunello di Montalcino</p></div><div class='pairing-card'><div class='food-icon'>🧀</div><h4>Pecorino 羊奶起司</h4><p>托斯卡納特產</p><p class='pairing-wine'>→ Vino Nobile</p></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🏰 知名酒莊巡禮</h2><div class='winery-tour'><div class='winery-intro'><p style='background:rgba(192,57,43,0.1);padding:15px;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #c0392b;margin-bottom:25px'>托斯卡納擁有眾多歷史悠久的家族酒莊，以及改寫產區歷史的創新先驅</p></div><div class='winery-cards'><div class='winery-card antinori-card'><div class='winery-header'><h3>🏛️ Marchesi Antinori</h3><div class='winery-subtitle'>托斯卡納葡萄酒貴族</div></div><div class='winery-body'><p class='winery-history'><strong>📅 歷史：</strong>1385年成立，26代家族傳承，超過630年歷史</p><p class='winery-innovation'><strong>🚀 創新：</strong>1970年代創造Tignanello，開啟超級托斯卡納時代</p><p class='winery-estates'><strong>🏰 莊園：</strong>遍布Chianti Classico、Montalcino、Bolgheri</p><p class='winery-wines'><strong>🍷 代表酒款：</strong></p><ul class='wine-list'><li>Tignanello - 超托經典</li><li>Solaia - Cabernet主導旗艦</li><li>Pèppoli Chianti Classico - 入門款</li><li>Guado al Tasso - Bolgheri產區</li></ul><p class='winery-style'><strong>🎯 風格：</strong>傳統與創新結合，兼顧Sangiovese傳統與國際化風格</p></div></div><div class='winery-card frescobaldi-card'><div class='winery-header'><h3>👑 Frescobaldi</h3><div class='winery-subtitle'>700年家族傳奇</div></div><div class='winery-body'><p class='winery-history'><strong>📅 歷史：</strong>1300年開始釀酒，文藝復興時期即供應教皇與皇室</p><p class='winery-innovation'><strong>🏰 城堡遺產：</strong>Nipozzano城堡是Chianti Rufina的標誌性莊園</p><p class='winery-estates'><strong>🗺️ 產區布局：</strong>11個莊園橫跨托斯卡納，涵蓋主要DOCG</p><p class='winery-wines'><strong>🍷 代表酒款：</strong></p><ul class='wine-list'><li>Nipozzano Chianti Rufina Riserva - 經典旗艦</li><li>Castelgiocondo Brunello - Montalcino莊園</li><li>Ornellaia - 2005年收購（與Antinori共同擁有）</li><li>Luce - 與Robert Mondavi合作</li></ul><p class='winery-style'><strong>🎯 風格：</strong>尊重傳統，強調風土表現，優雅精緻</p></div></div><div class='winery-card banfi-card'><div class='winery-header'><h3>🇺🇸 Castello Banfi</h3><div class='winery-subtitle'>Brunello 現代化推手</div></div><div class='winery-body'><p class='winery-history'><strong>📅 歷史：</strong>1978年由美國Mariani家族創立（義大利裔）</p><p class='winery-innovation'><strong>🚀 革命性貢獻：</strong>將現代釀酒科技帶入Montalcino，大規模種植實驗</p><p class='winery-estates'><strong>🏰 規模：</strong>7,100英畝，其中2,800英畝葡萄園，Montalcino最大莊園</p><p class='winery-wines'><strong>🍷 代表酒款：</strong></p><ul class='wine-list'><li>Brunello di Montalcino DOCG - 旗艦款</li><li>Poggio alle Mura Brunello Riserva - 單一園</li><li>Excelsus - 超級托斯卡納</li><li>Summus - Merlot + Sangiovese + Cabernet + Syrah</li></ul><p class='winery-style'><strong>🎯 風格：</strong>現代、國際化、果香奔放、易飲親民</p></div></div><div class='winery-card sassicaia-card'><div class='winery-header'><h3>🌊 Tenuta San Guido</h3><div class='winery-subtitle'>超級托斯卡納始祖</div></div><div class='winery-body'><p class='winery-history'><strong>📅 歷史：</strong>Marchese Mario Incisa della Rocchetta於1940年代開始實驗種植Cabernet</p><p class='winery-innovation'><strong>🚀 革命創舉：</strong>1968年Sassicaia首發，開創托斯卡納海岸產區新紀元</p><p class='winery-estates'><strong>🏖️ 風土：</strong>Bolgheri海岸，礫石土壤，類似波爾多左岸</p><p class='winery-wines'><strong>🍷 代表酒款：</strong></p><ul class='wine-list'><li>Sassicaia Bolgheri DOC - 唯一擁有專屬DOC的單一酒款</li><li>Guidalberto - 副牌，Merlot + Sangiovese + Cabernet</li><li>Le Difese - 入門款（與Tenuta dell'Ornellaia合作）</li></ul><p class='winery-style'><strong>🎯 風格：</strong>優雅、波爾多風格、雪松香氣、絲滑單寧</p><p class='winery-legend'><strong>🏆 傳奇：</strong>1985年獲《Decanter》盲品冠軍，超越波爾多一級酒莊</p></div></div><div class='winery-card gaja-card'><div class='winery-header'><h3>🍷 Gaja (Ca' Marcanda)</h3><div class='winery-subtitle'>Piemonte 巨頭的托斯卡納征程</div></div><div class='winery-body'><p class='winery-history'><strong>📅 歷史：</strong>Angelo Gaja 於1996年進軍Bolgheri，購買Ca' Marcanda莊園</p><p class='winery-innovation'><strong>🚀 Piemonte傳奇：</strong>Gaja是Barbaresco的代名詞，將Piemonte的精準帶入托斯卡納</p><p class='winery-estates'><strong>🗺️ 托斯卡納布局：</strong>Ca' Marcanda (Bolgheri) + Pieve Santa Restituta (Montalcino)</p><p class='winery-wines'><strong>🍷 代表酒款：</strong></p><ul class='wine-list'><li>Ca' Marcanda Camarcanda - Merlot主導混釀</li><li>Magari - Cabernet Franc主導</li><li>Promis - 入門超托</li><li>Pieve Santa Restituta Brunello - Montalcino旗艦</li></ul><p class='winery-style'><strong>🎯 風格：</strong>精準、現代、濃郁、國際化但不失優雅</p></div></div></div><div class='winery-map-section'><h3>🗺️ 酒莊地理分布</h3><div class='winery-distribution'><div class='distribution-zone'><h4>Chianti Classico 區</h4><p>Antinori (總部), Frescobaldi (Nipozzano)</p></div><div class='distribution-zone'><h4>Montalcino 區</h4><p>Banfi, Frescobaldi (Castelgiocondo), Gaja (Pieve Santa Restituta)</p></div><div class='distribution-zone'><h4>Bolgheri 海岸區</h4><p>Tenuta San Guido (Sassicaia), Ornellaia (Frescobaldi), Gaja (Ca' Marcanda), Antinori (Guado al Tasso)</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class='slide'><h2>🎓 重點回顧</h2><div class='summary-points'><div class='point-item'>✓ Sangiovese 是托斯卡納的靈魂品種，擁有多種地方變種</div><div class='point-item'>✓ Brunello = 最強勁，Chianti Classico = 最經典</div><div class='point-item'>✓ Chianti Classico 2014年新增Gran Selezione等級</div><div class='point-item'>✓ 超級托斯卡納打破傳統創造新風格，Sassicaia開創先河</div><div class='point-item'>✓ Bolgheri海岸產區崛起，成為國際品種理想家園</div><div class='point-item'>✓ 傳統家族酒莊與創新精神並存，塑造托斯卡納多元風貌</div><div class='point-item'>✓ 高酸度使其成為餐酒搭配之王</div></div></section></div><style>.region-overview{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:15px;margin:20px 0}.overview-item{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f8f9fa,#e9ecef);padding:18px;border-radius:10px;text-align:center;borde